[2026-03-15T20:42:51.356Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CDW4aCjNNVY6MCuqdRCHua","type":"tool_result","content":"  1350→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Submit Review\" button.\n  1351→- **Expected:** The review is submitted successfully (comment is optional per the data model). The app navigates back to `/trips`.\n  1352→\n  1353→#### Test: Submit button is disabled when ratings are not set\n  1354→- **Initial state:** User navigates to the Write Review page. No rating sliders have been adjusted from their unset/default state.\n  1355→- **Expected:** The \"Submit Review\" button is disabled or grayed out, preventing submission without ratings.\n  1356→\n  1357→#### Test: Form validation prevents submission without all ratings\n  1358→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page. User has set Overall to 5 but left other rating sliders unset.\n  1359→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Submit Review\" button.\n  1360→- **Expected:** The form shows a validation error indicating all ratings are required (e.g., \"Please rate all categories\"). The review is not submitted.\n  1361→\n  1362→#### Test: Write Review button on My Trips disappears after submitting review\n  1363→- **Initial state:** User has a completed booking for \"Oceanfront Villa\" showing a \"Write Review\" button on the My Trips page.\n  1364→- **Action:** User clicks \"Write Review\", fills out all ratings (all set to 4) and a comment \"Great stay!\", and clicks \"Submit Review\". User is redirected to `/trips`.\n  1365→- **Expected:** The trip card for \"Oceanfront Villa\" no longer shows the \"Write Review\" button. It may show \"Reviewed\" text or a checkmark instead.\n  1366→\n  1367→#### Test: Navigate back from review page without submitting\n  1368→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page and has set some ratings and typed partial comment text.\n  1369→- **Action:** User clicks the browser back button or a \"Cancel\" / back navigation link on the page.\n  1370→- **Expected:** The user is taken back to `/trips`. No review is submitted. The \"Write Review\" button still appears on the trip card.\n  1371→\n  1372→#### Test: Comment text area allows multi-line input\n  1373→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page.\n  1374→- **Action:** User types a multi-line comment: \"First line.\\nSecond line.\\nThird line.\" using Enter/Return key to create line breaks.\n  1375→- **Expected:** The text area displays the comment with line breaks preserved across all three lines.\n  1376→\n  1377→#### Test: Re-visiting review page after submission shows already-reviewed state\n  1378→- **Initial state:** User \"guest@example.com\" has already submitted a review for booking-789.\n  1379→- **Action:** User navigates to `/trips/booking-789/review` directly via URL.\n  1380→- **Expected:** The page displays a message such as \"You have already reviewed this booking\" instead of the review form. A link to return to My Trips is available.\n  1381→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01QRK6nFTDC6ZvfqZwqEr5Mr","session_id":"9bffb10d-41eb-4f04-b786-b79afb133992","uuid":"ef0a6e84-9429-4727-a281-f4085b370599"}
