[2026-03-15T20:47:37.567Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01U1ePQWC4iw1hQybMSzUsLM","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now let me create a comprehensive summary of all the files found:\n\n## Summary of Home/Search Page Files\n\nI've successfully located all component and page files related to the Home/Search page in the AirbnbClone application. Here are the complete file paths:\n\n### Page Component\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/Home.tsx`\n\n### Component Files\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/SearchBar.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/CategoryFilter.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyGrid.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyCard.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/FavoriteButton.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/FiltersPanel.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/Pagination.tsx`\n\n### Redux Slices\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/propertiesSlice.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/favoritesSlice.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/amenitiesSlice.ts`\n\n### Netlify Functions (Backend APIs)\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/properties.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/favorites.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/amenities.ts`\n\n### App Routing\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/App.tsx`\n\n### Architecture Overview\n\n**Routing**: The Home page is mapped to the \"/\" route in App.tsx and renders the Home component.\n\n**Home Page Structure**: The Home page orchestrates multiple components:\n1. **SearchBar** - Handles city, check-in/check-out dates, and guest count\n2. **CategoryFilter** - Property type selection (Apartment, House, Cabin, Villa, Condo, Loft, Cottage, Townhouse)\n3. **FiltersPanel** - Advanced filtering (price range, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms, amenities)\n4. **PropertyGrid** - Displays properties in a responsive grid layout\n5. **PropertyCard** - Individual property card with favorite button and rating\n6. **FavoriteButton** - Heart icon to add/remove favorites (only shown for logged-in users)\n7. **Pagination** - Page navigation for search results\n\n**State Management**: Redux manages:\n- `propertiesSlice` - Property list, filters, pagination state\n- `favoritesSlice` - User's favorite property IDs and favorites operations\n- `amenitiesSlice` - Available amenities for filtering\n\n**Backend APIs**: Netlify functions handle:\n- `properties.ts` - GET (search/list with filters), POST (create), PUT (update), DELETE (deactivate)\n- `favorites.ts` - GET (fetch user favorites), POST (add favorite), DELETE (remove favorite)\n- `amenities.ts` - GET (fetch all amenities)"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a30eaed921aa3a1e9 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 41928\ntool_uses: 20\nduration_ms: 23988</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9bffb10d-41eb-4f04-b786-b79afb133992","uuid":"53afdc4c-6aa6-4cb4-93e6-a292f3bbf565","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In /repo/apps/AirbnbClone, find all component and page files related to the Home / Search page. This includes:\n- The home page component (likely in src/pages/)\n- SearchBar component\n- CategoryFilter component\n- PropertyGrid component\n- PropertyCard component\n- FavoriteButton component\n- FiltersPanel component\n- Pagination component\n- Any related Redux slices (in src/slices/)\n- Any related Netlify functions (in netlify/functions/) for properties, favorites, etc.\n\nReturn the full file paths of all found files. Also read src/App.tsx to understand routing.","agentId":"a30eaed921aa3a1e9","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now let me create a comprehensive summary of all the files found:\n\n## Summary of Home/Search Page Files\n\nI've successfully located all component and page files related to the Home/Search page in the AirbnbClone application. Here are the complete file paths:\n\n### Page Component\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/Home.tsx`\n\n### Component Files\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/SearchBar.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/CategoryFilter.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyGrid.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyCard.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/FavoriteButton.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/FiltersPanel.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/Pagination.tsx`\n\n### Redux Slices\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/propertiesSlice.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/favoritesSlice.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/amenitiesSlice.ts`\n\n### Netlify Functions (Backend APIs)\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/properties.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/favorites.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/amenities.ts`\n\n### App Routing\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/App.tsx`\n\n### Architecture Overview\n\n**Routing**: The Home page is mapped to the \"/\" route in App.tsx and renders the Home component.\n\n**Home Page Structure**: The Home page orchestrates multiple components:\n1. **SearchBar** - Handles city, check-in/check-out dates, and guest count\n2. **CategoryFilter** - Property type selection (Apartment, House, Cabin, Villa, Condo, Loft, Cottage, Townhouse)\n3. **FiltersPanel** - Advanced filtering (price range, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms, amenities)\n4. **PropertyGrid** - Displays properties in a responsive grid layout\n5. **PropertyCard** - Individual property card with favorite button and rating\n6. **FavoriteButton** - Heart icon to add/remove favorites (only shown for logged-in users)\n7. **Pagination** - Page navigation for search results\n\n**State Management**: Redux manages:\n- `propertiesSlice` - Property list, filters, pagination state\n- `favoritesSlice` - User's favorite property IDs and favorites operations\n- `amenitiesSlice` - Available am